 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. QFILE.
 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     QUERY STATUS IS WS-QSTAT.
 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
 FILE-CONTROL.
     SELECT CUST-FILE ASSIGN TO "CUST.DAT"
         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
         RELATIVE KEY IS CUST-KEY
         FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 FILE SECTION.
 FD  CUST-FILE.
 01  CUST-REC.
     05  CUST-NAME   PIC X(20).
     05  CUST-BAL    PIC 9(8).
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  CUST-KEY    PIC 9(4) COMP.
 01  FILE-STAT   PIC XX.
 01  WS-QSTAT    PIC 99.
 01  WS-HITS     PIC 9(4).
 01  WS-REC      PIC 9(4).
 01  WS-NAME     PIC X(20).
 01  WS-BAL      PIC 9(6)V99.
 01  WS-SHOW     PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
 01  WS-TXT      PIC X(6).
 01  WS-EOF      PIC X VALUE "N".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     QUERY "BIGBAL" USING "CUST" OF CUST-FILE
         GIVING WS-HITS
         ON ERROR DISPLAY "E0 " WS-QSTAT.
     OPEN OUTPUT CUST-FILE.
     MOVE 1 TO CUST-KEY.
     MOVE "ZED" TO CUST-NAME.
     MOVE 150 TO CUST-BAL.
     WRITE CUST-REC.
     MOVE 2 TO CUST-KEY.
     MOVE "AMY" TO CUST-NAME.
     MOVE 50 TO CUST-BAL.
     WRITE CUST-REC.
     MOVE 3 TO CUST-KEY.
     MOVE "EVE" TO CUST-NAME.
     MOVE 1000 TO CUST-BAL.
     WRITE CUST-REC.
     MOVE 4 TO CUST-KEY.
     MOVE "CAL" TO CUST-NAME.
     MOVE 99 TO CUST-BAL.
     WRITE CUST-REC.
     MOVE 5 TO CUST-KEY.
     MOVE "BOB" TO CUST-NAME.
     MOVE 101 TO CUST-BAL.
     WRITE CUST-REC.
     CLOSE CUST-FILE.
     OPEN I-O CUST-FILE.
     MOVE 1 TO CUST-KEY.
     DELETE CUST-FILE.
     DISPLAY "D " FILE-STAT.
     QUERY "BIGBAL" USING "CUST" OF CUST-FILE
         GIVING WS-HITS
         ON ERROR DISPLAY "E1 " WS-QSTAT.
     DISPLAY "A " WS-QSTAT " " WS-HITS.
     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
         QUERY NEXT GIVING WS-REC AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
         IF WS-EOF = "N"
             QUERY FIELD 0 INTO WS-NAME
             QUERY FIELD 1 INTO WS-BAL
             QUERY FIELD 1 INTO WS-TXT
             MOVE WS-BAL TO WS-SHOW
             DISPLAY WS-REC " " WS-NAME WS-SHOW " " WS-TXT
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM.
     CLOSE CUST-FILE.
     STOP RUN.
